        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Charles Barkley, Magic Johnson\n- Organizations: Philadelphia 76ers, Los Angeles Lakers, National Basketball Association\n- Topics: jersey numbers, retirement, HIV, basketball roles\n\nFacts:\n- Earvin \"Magic\" Johnson Jr. was born on August 14, 1959.\n- Magic Johnson is an American retired professional basketball player.\n- Magic Johnson is the current president of basketball operations for the Los Angeles Lakers of the National Basketball Association.\n- During the 1991–92 Philadelphia 76ers season, Charles Barkley changed his jersey number to 32 in honor of Magic Johnson.\n- Charles Barkley made the jersey-number change because Magic Johnson retired due to HIV.",
